"""CJA1117B-3.3 - 1 A low-dropout linear regulator, fixed 3.3 V output, SOT-89-3. Bare part.

Datasheet: JCET (Jiangsu Changjiang Electronics Technology) CJA1117B-XXX, rev. E, March 2016.

Pins (page 1, SOT-89-3L): 1 ADJ/GND, 2 OUTPUT, 3 IN. The tab is the OUTPUT lead: the
footprint draws tab and centre lead as one copper pad numbered 2, plus a small anchor pad 2.

Absolute maximum ratings (page 2): input voltage 20 V; junction temperature 150 C.
Recommended operating conditions (page 2): input voltage 15 V max; TJ -25 to 125 C;
RthJA 250 C/W (page 3 note: 46 to > 90 C/W with copper area over a plane).

Electrical characteristics (page 3, TJ = 25 C): output 3.234 / 3.3 / 3.366 V for
10 mA <= IOUT <= 1 A and 4.8 V <= VIN <= 12 V (3.251 / 3.3 / 3.350 V at 10 mA, VIN = 5.3 V);
dropout 1.3 V max at 1 A; current limit 1 A min at VIN - VOUT = 2 V; quiescent current
5 / 10 mA; ripple rejection 60 / 75 dB at 120 Hz measured with COUT = 22 uF tantalum.

Output capacitor: the CJA1117B datasheet gives no capacitance or ESR requirement; its only
reference is the 22 uF tantalum of the ripple-rejection test (page 3). For the same 1117
architecture, TI LM1117 (SNOS412Q, section 9.2.2.1.3, p15) requires an output capacitor ESR
of 0.3 to 22 Ohm, and the AMS1117 datasheet (Advanced Monolithic Systems, p4 "Stability")
asks for 22 uF solid tantalum on the output. A board that uses this part must show that its
output capacitor meets one of these, or accept the stability risk explicitly.
Input capacitor: not specified by JCET; TI LM1117 recommends 10 uF tantalum on the input
(SNOS412Q, section 9.2.2.1.1, p14).

Integrator-owned circuitry: input and output capacitors.
"""

# Page 2 (recommended input voltage, 15 V max) and page 3 (output specified for
# 4.8 V <= VIN, 10 mA to 1 A).
VIN = io(Power(voltage="4.8V to 15V"))
VOUT = io(Power(voltage="3.234V to 3.366V"))
GND = io(Ground)

Component(
    name="CJA1117B",
    prefix="U",
    symbol=Symbol(library="CJA1117B.kicad_sym"),
    footprint=File("SOT-89-3_L4.5-W2.5-P1.50-LS4.2-BR.kicad_mod"),
    part=Part(mpn="CJA1117B-3.3", manufacturer="JCET"),
    pins={
        "ADJ/GND": GND,
        "OUTPUT": VOUT,
        "IN": VIN,
    },
)
